{'symbol': 'ALK', 'date': '2021-11-02 08:00:00', 'title': 'ALASKA AIRLINES ENHANCES ITS GLOBAL REACH WITH EXPANDED BRITISH AIRWAYS CODESHARE', 'text': "SEATTLE, NOV. 2, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ALASKA AIRLINES ANNOUNCES TODAY A FURTHER CODESHARE EXPANSION WITH OUR LONG-TIME EUROPEAN PARTNER BRITISH AIRWAYS, A FELLOW MEMBER OF THE ONEWORLD ALLIANCE. THIS EXPANSION INCLUDES 16 ADDITIONAL MARKETS, CONNECTING ALASKA'S NETWORK BEYOND SEATTLE, SAN FRANCISCO AND LOS ANGELES\xa0TO BRITISH AIRWAYS' NONSTOP SERVICE FROM LONDON HEATHROW."}